# oracle: pair_style granular mdr with unequal radii (elastic, Y 1000, no adhesion): a sphere of diameter 1 and one of diameter 0.6 approach head-on and collide, damping mdr 2, tangential linear_nohistory, fix nve/sphere
# native: b332f28 (the installed lmp, GRANULAR included). Measured (engine vs native, black box; rel over |value| >= 1e-6; per-atom scale max(1,|value|)): thermo max rel 3.3e-15, per-atom max scaled 0; engine 15 ms.
units           lj
atom_style      sphere 1
atom_modify     map array
comm_modify     vel yes
newton          off
boundary        f f f
region          b block -10 10 -10 10 -10 10
create_box      2 b
create_atoms    1 single -0.6 0.05 0.0
create_atoms    2 single 0.5 -0.02 0.0
set type 1 diameter 1.0 density 1.0
set type 2 diameter 0.6 density 1.0
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 units box
set             atom 1 vx 0.4 vy 0.0 vz 0.0
set             atom 2 vx -0.3 vy 0.0 vz 0.0
pair_style      granular
pair_coeff      * * mdr 1.0 0.3 1000.0 0.0 0.5 0.1 damping mdr 2 tangential linear_nohistory 0.0 0.0
timestep        0.005
fix             1 all nve/sphere
thermo_style    custom step ke
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          40
run             400
